WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.040
<b>Is it true, Yoh-dono?</b>

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:12.300
<b>Yeah, I was shocked too when I
found out Hao was Matamune's master.</b>

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.510
<b>This is beyond belief, I'm speechless.</b>

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.390
<b>Well, we have lots of time now.
Wanna talk about it, Amidamaru?</b>

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:27.270
<b>I feel much less stressed now
that I'm out of the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:34.400
<b>Yoh-dono helped Ren-dono and gave
up on his dream to be Shaman King...</b>

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:40.790
<b>At least now we won't have to fight
any more of those pointless battles.</b>

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.140
<b>Then again, there are still
some things I have to do.</b>

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.580
<b>Like defeat Hao?</b>

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:50.840
<b>That's the mission of the Asakura.</b>

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.960
<b>You promised the kitty cat, remember?</b>

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.680
<b>It's your life's work.</b>

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.340
<b>So?</b>

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.520
<b>I was supposed to become the first lady.
What happens to me now, Yoh?</b>

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.190
<b>A-Anna...</b>

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.480
<b>S-Sor...</b>

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.030
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:16.450
<b><i>The phantom left!</i></b>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.450
<b>I forgive you.</b>

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:22.720
<b>I knew you were too
soft-hearted from the start.</b>

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.260
<b>That's why I fell in love with you.</b>

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.880
<b>But our journey isn't over.</b>

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.420
<b>You can't relax yet, Yoh.</b>

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:39.760
<b>Haha, she's forgiven you, Yoh-dono.</b>

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:42.890
<b>Yoh-dono!</b>

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:48.970
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

