Officiants to get his Oracle Bell.</b>

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:55.100
<b>As the X-Laws, Apostles of Justice, we cannot
tolerate the evil that sleeps within him.</b>

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:56.900
<b>But...</b>

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:01.030
<b>I promised Asakura Yoh
I would revive his friend.</b>

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:08.330
<b>Yoh may be the detestable Hao's brother,
but a promise made must be fulfilled.</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:11.000
<b>The just must never break the law.</b>

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.410
<b>Maiden-sama</b>

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.000
<b><i>What's with that look on his face?</i></b>

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.440
<b>Your words are always a blessing.</b>

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:24.010
<b>I must've been blinded by the evil before me.</b>

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.800
<b>Please forgive me.</b>

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:31.390
<b>But who knows what this
scoundrel will do when he wakes up?</b>

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:36.560
<b>He may suddenly attack you, Maiden-sama.</b>

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.820
<b>If he does, may I execute him?</b>

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:45.320
<b>Yes, my promise will
have been fulfilled by then.</b>

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.910
<b><i>He wants the young master dead!</i></b>

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.080
<b>Manta...</b>

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:56.120
<b>You sure you want to
go see how Ren's doing?</b>

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.580
<b>Of course!</b>

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:00.340
<b>Yoh-kun quit the Shaman Fight...</b>

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:03.130
<b>And I don't know where
Horohoro and Chocolove are!</b>

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:07.090
<b>If Ren dies, what will happen
to our group of friends?</b>

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:11.010
<b>Well, don't worry.</b>

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:16.560
<b>Boss Yoh will straighten everything out.</b>

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:21.320
<b>For now, let's go check out the babes.</b>

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:23.230
<b>Hang on tight!</b>

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:27.160
<b>Who said anything about babes?!</b>

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.700
<b>I'm Chrom, one of the 10 Officiants.</b>

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.580
<b>Hit me just once and you pass the test.</b>

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.300
<b>Come, Tao Ren!</b>

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:46.380
<b>One blow from me could be lethal.</b>

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.340
<b>You're definitely confident.</b>

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:55.560
<b>How annoying, you didn't
even flinch at my surprise attack.</b>

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.140
<b>He's dangerous.</b>

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:00.620
<b>The purpose of this test is to
confirm that he can form an Over Soul.</b>

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:01.610
<b>This is enough.</b>

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.040
<b>Am I dreaming?</b>

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.250
<b>This memory...</b>

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:25.000
<b>The qualification test
for the Shaman Fight...</b>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.090
<b>They say your life flashes
before your eyes when you die.</b>

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.640
<b>Tao Ren...</b>

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:39.350
<b>You attack as though you're
trying to kill your own fear.</b>

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.860
<b>You belittle your enemy
to shake his confidence.</b>

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:49.280
<b>You'd better note your
opponent's abilities...</b>

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.910
<b>If you don't want to get killed.</b>

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:55.370
<b>Still standing after my attack, eh?</b>

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:58.370
<b>And now you want to lecture me?</b>

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:01.170
<b>You really are annoying.</b>

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.340
<b>Such strength...</b>

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.420
<b>You remind me of my little brother.</b>

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.380
<b>Very well.</b>

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:16.060
<b>You hit me, as required. But keep training.</b>

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:18.270
<b>No...</b>

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:20.890
<b>Don't...</b>

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.270
<b>Don't do it!</b>

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:25.940
<b>What a fool.</b>

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:28.690
<b>I've no need of your approval.</b>

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.990
<b>I'll destroy you and take what I need.</b>

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.870
<b>An unforgivable crime.</b>

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.660
<b>All sins arise from weakness of the soul.</b>

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:47.800
<b>I tried to hide my weakness by hurting others.</b>

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.300
<b>That is why I got stabbed like that.</b>

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:55.550
<b>But for my sake...</b>

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.310
<b>Yoh withdrew from the Shaman Fight?!</b>

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:02.940
<b>That's unacceptable!</b>

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.940
<b>This is it, Ryu.</b>

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:10.860
<b>They're all here, I saw
them when I peeked inside.</b>

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.740
<b>So all the babes
are in there, huh?</b>

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:16.870
<b>Let's go in.</b>

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.330
<b>Gentlemen...</b>

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:21.950
<b>Do you know the story of sleeping beauty?</b>

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.710
<b>You mean the fairy tale?</b>

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.460
<b>Yes.</b>

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:30.130
<b>But it's not just a fairy tale.</b>

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:34.420
<b>The princess fell into an endless
sleep because of a witch's curse.</b>

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.840
<b>And was awakened by the kiss of a prince.</b>

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:41.640
<b>But even miracles have causes.</b>

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:45.060
<b>The prince was a shamanic healer.</b>

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.480
<b>Y-You don't mean...</b>

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:52.190
<b>Tao Ren will also be revived with a kiss.</b>

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:53.490
<b>What?!</b>

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.280
<b><i>Our father, who art in heaven...</i></b>

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.200
<b><i>Heal this boy's body.</i></b>

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.870
<b><i>And return his soul so that he may live again!</i></b>

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.000
<b>Ryu-san?!</b>

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.000
<b>Maiden-chan!</b>

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:14.880
<b>Kill me and bring me back to live too!</b>

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.510
<b>A kiss from Shamash?</b>

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.020
<b>R-Ryu-san...</b>

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:24.390
<b>You fool...</b>

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:27.440
<b>How dare you disrupt our sacred ceremony!</b>

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.770
<b>You should die for this, you imbecile!</b>

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.650
<b>He's right.</b>

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.860
<b>If you'd gotten here sooner...</b>

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.490
<b>I wouldn't have had to come back to life.</b>

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.790
<b>You're late, Ryu!</b>

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.410
<b>Ren!
Young Master!</b>

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.500
<b>You say the craziest things.</b>

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:51.880
<b>You should grovel at
Maiden-sama's feet for reviving you.</b>

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.760
<b>Don't you understand?!</b>

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.630
<b>I don't recall asking for help.</b>

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.470
<b>In fact, it's a nuisance.</b>

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.850
<b>Death Penalty!</b>

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.230
<b>Sword Mirage</b>

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:18.570
<b>Amazing, an extraordinary
increase in Furyoku indeed.</b>

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:23.160
<b>Xie Xie, Yoh.</b>

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:23.150
TL note: "Xie Xie" is Chinese for thank you.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.090
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.930
<b>That kid outmaneuvered our angels.</b>

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:42.550
<b>Aren't we going after Tao Ren?</b>

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:44.530
<b>It doesn't matter.</b>

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:47.220
<b>All that matters is that Maiden-sama is safe.</b>

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.560
<b>Besides...</b>

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.540
<b>Tao Ren has come back to life.</b>

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:58.280
<b>Asakura Yoh has to withdraw
from the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.950
<b>Amidamaru...</b>

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.800
<b>I'm sorry about all this.</b>

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.790
<b>You're awake!</b>

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:09.460
<b>Don't worry about me.</b>

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:13.090
<b>Thank you for sharing your
precious memories with me.</b>

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.800
<b>My desire to serve you is stronger than ever.</b>

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:19.130
<b>Precious memories?</b>

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:22.550
<b>A man who easily abandons his dreams...</b>

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.720
<b>Must not have an interesting story to tell.</b>

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.310
<b>You came back to life, Ren!</b>

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:30.520
<b>What's with your face?!</b>

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:32.350
<b>Geez...</b>

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:36.770
<b>He just got brought back to
life and all he can do is complain.</b>

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:39.110
<b>He was all like "Where is Yoh?!"</b>

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:41.610
<b>And he came rushing over here.</b>

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.820
<b>Yeah, I figured.</b>

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.960
<b>Forgive me, I brought
you back without asking.</b>

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.120
<b>You should be sorry.</b>

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:56.630
<b>Saving me might make you feel
better, but now I'm indebted to you again.</b>

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:00.340
<b>But isn't it better than being dead?</b>

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:12.520
<b>Wow, you were left with a big scar.</b>

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:19.150
<b>Yeah, Ryu burst in before
Maiden could finish healing me.</b>

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.360
<b>What?!</b>

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.950
<b>I'm sorry Ren, I didn't mean to.</b>

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:29.080
<b>Thanks to you, the cycle of
hatred has been further disrupted.</b>

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:34.830
<b>I still want to make amends to Nichrom.</b>

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:39.320
<b>But now I have a physical reminder.</b>

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.590
<b>I vowed never to waver from my path.</b>

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.300
<b>I'm grateful to be alive.</b>

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:51.270
<b>No big deal, just don't get
yourself killed again, Ren.</b>

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:56.770
<b>Hey cheer up already.</b>

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.900
<b>I'm just trying to help out a teammate!</b>

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.740
<b>Teammate?</b>

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.450
<b>Cheesecake</b>

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.990
<b>Hey, come on!</b>

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.370
<b>You're not funny.</b>

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.420
<b>I just want to get stronger.</b>

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:30.970
<b>I'm curious to see how you will fight
Hao-sama with Furyoku of only 2000.</b>

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.390
<b>I swear I will!</b>

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.280
<b>Big Guy Bill!</b>

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.530
<b>What's he doing here?</b>

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:50.450
<b>You guys cannot leave this island.</b>

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.200
<b>Your souls belong to Hao-sama now.</b>

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:59.290
<b>Why did we have to run into
Hao's minions? What rotten luck.</b>

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.750
<b>The Ice Men! They're still here?!</b>

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:05.260
<b>Damn it, we gotta help them.</b>

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.550
<b>Let's go Kororo.</b>

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:11.600
<b>Pino, is that his body?!</b>

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.220
<b>It must be his medium.</b>

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.850
<b>How rude. I'm a participant, small fry.</b>

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.230
<b>Who are you calling small fry?!</b>

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:25.690
<b>Ever since I lost most of my physical body,
I've used this Over Soul in its place.</b>

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:30.070
<b>In exchange for the loss of my body, I
gained an enormous amount of Furyoku.</b>

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:38.000
<b>Big Guy Bill's Furyoku is the result of injuries
sustained in the battle with the X-Laws.</b>

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.630
<b>Our combined Furyoku is 200,000.</b>

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.250
<b>200,000?!</b>

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:48.560
<b>All of you have a combined Furyoku of 6900.</b>

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.060
<b>Considering our overwhelming superiority...</b>

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:55.220
<b>I don't see a problem calling you small fry.</b>

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.390
<b>You gotta be kidding me...</b>

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:03.440
<b>What could I do for them? It'd be suicide.</b>

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.610
<b>Y-Yeah you're right.</b>

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.950
<b>But if I don't do something, they'll get killed.</b>

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.910
<b>But I can't get myself get killed here.</b>

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.040
<b>It's survival of the fittest.</b>

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.630
<b>Only the strong survive,
the weak fall by the wayside.</b>

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.130
<b>I'm sorry, everyone.</b>

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.470
<b>I'm sorry, Ice Men.</b>

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:35.600
<b>I'm sorry, dad.</b>

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:41.100
<b>I'm such a stupid son.</b>

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.900
<b>You're that kid from...</b>

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:46.940
<b>H-Horohoro?!</b>

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.440
<b>You idiot, what're you doing here?!</b>

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:53.080
<b>Yeah, I know I'm stupid.</b>

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:57.660
<b>The problem is, numbers don’t mean much
to me. I gotta see your Furyoku in action.</b>

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.830
<b>Y'see, I suck at math</b>

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.620
<b>Zang Ching's logic, huh.</b>

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:09.050
<b>You might've had a chance if you'd
done a surprise attack from behind.</b>

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.190
<b>Oh, sure.</b>

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.470
<b>I'm dumb, but I'm not that dumb.</b>

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.470
<b>Big touchdown!</b>

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:27.060
<b>You ride the waves of
Furyoku to evade blows...</b>

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:32.650
<b>If you guys can do that,
what good is a surprise attack?</b>

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:36.820
<b>The Shamanic Oracle.</b>

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:41.160
<b>But if this is about riding waves, I
can do that even better than Ren.</b>

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:47.920
<b>They are all so stubborn and irresponsible.</b>

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.170
<b>But there's no use crying about it.</b>

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.130
<b>I gotta be Shaman King for them!</b>

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:58.850
<b>You're gonna be the Shaman King?</b>

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:02.980
<b>Horohoro!</b>

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.140
<b>That's crazy talk.</b>

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:08.610
<b>Only Hao-sama is allowed to say that.</b>

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.820
<b>Hao-sama, Tao Ren has been revived.</b>

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:19.620
<b>That means Yoh-sama is out of the fight.</b>

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:24.770
<b>I don't see why he cares about
his promise with the X-Laws.</b>

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:28.960
<b>We can go crush them now if you want.</b>

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.250
<b>No need.</b>

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.260
<b>Yoh's quarrel is with me alone.</b>

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.220
<b>But I'm sure he'll return...</b>

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:39.970
<b>And become one with me yet.</b>

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.180
<b>Hao-sama</b>

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:47.440
<b>Big Guy Bill and Blocken are
fighting Horohoro and the Ice Men.</b>

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.900
<b>So small...</b>

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:59.530
<b>This is the reality of our
overwhelming power difference.</b>

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:06.160
<b>He jumped in to save his friends
knowing he'd probably get killed.</b>

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.790
<b>Or maybe he's just an idiot?</b>

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.630
<b>Show me what you're made of!</b>

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.010
<b>He's in a tight spot.</b>

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.050
<b>Father</b>

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:22.180
<b>He's under my charge so,
as an Officiant, I can't interfere.</b>

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:25.100
<b>But this isn't an official battle.</b>

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.890
<b>You can help him if you want.</b>

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:29.520
<b>C'mon daddy!</b>

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.400
<b>Please save big bro! If you don't he'll...</b>

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:38.900
<b>I came because Pirika begged me to.</b>

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:39.950
<b>Daddy!</b>

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:42.780
<b>This is survival of the fittest.</b>

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:46.580
<b>The bird that leaves
the nest is on its own.</b>

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.670
<b>Now I'm leaving.</b>

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.920
<b>Huh? Who are you
and what are you doing?!</b>

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.840
<b>Dad?</b>

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.090
<b>I need a raft to get off this island.</b>

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.390
<b>You're a Shaman, too?</b>

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.180
<b>Your Furyoku seems pretty high.</b>

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.640
<b>I'm just a regular office worker.</b>

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:11.520
<b>Too bad for you.</b>

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.270
<b>I'll take your soul for Hao-sama!</b>

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.900
<b>Survival of the fittest...</b>

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:22.450
<b>It doesn't mean resigning yourself to fate.</b>

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.410
<b>How can this be?</b>

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.660
<b>A man with only 5000
Furyoku flattened Bill?</b>

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.750
<b>This can only mean one thing...</b>

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:39.970
<b>I'd better kill these people
before things get out of hand.</b>

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.510
<b>Oh no you don't.</b>

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:45.430
<b>Leave now or suffer the consequences.</b>

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.520
<b>What's he thinking?!</b>

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:49.980
<b>Pirika-chan.</b>

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:52.950
<b>Can you tell me about
your father's spirit?</b>

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:55.890
<b>Gororo is a Goropokkur</b>

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:59.640
<b>He's gentle and powerful and he
has a lot of spiritual power, so daddy...</b>

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.610
<b>Power?! So that's what it is.</b>

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:09.490
<b>That's how someone with less Furyoku beats
someone with more, with a powerful spirit ally!</b>

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.790
<b>So you figured it out.</b>

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:15.500
<b>Well, it won't make any difference.</b>

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:20.170
<b>Have a look at my Over Soul.</b>

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:25.590
<b>This is my real body.</b>

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:29.430
<b>My limbless torso sits inside.</b>

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.980
<b>Would you like to know
how I ended up like this?</b>

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:35.100
<b>Not really.</b>

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:36.900
<b>I see.</b>

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.650
<b>Then die!</b>

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:44.860
<b>Over Soul: Die-Block!</b>

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:47.160
<b>These blocks are my medium!</b>

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:51.080
<b>I control the spirit inside
each individual block!</b>

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:53.330
<b>You don't stand a chance!</b>

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.710
<b>True, I don't have much Furyoku.</b>

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:01.170
<b>And Kororo's spiritual
power may be less than yours.</b>

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:06.300
<b>But now I’ve got these guys backing me up.</b>

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.970
<b>The spirit allies of the Ice Men?!</b>

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.430
<b>Impossible Impossible Impossible!</b>

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:15.020
<b>How can you control spirits that
have more power than you do?!</b>

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.190
<b>Are you scared?</b>

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:21.710
<b>If you're that freaked out, I must
have more spiritual power than you.</b>

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:24.280
<b>Survival of the fittest.</b>

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:27.030
<b>My dad used to preach it all the time.</b>

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:34.370
<b>The laws of nature can't be broken, but sometimes
it's good to know things can't be changed.</b>

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:40.090
<b>The skies have their kings
and the oceans have theirs...</b>

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:44.970
<b>The lion may be the king of
beasts, but it can't fly or swim.</b>

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:49.340
<b>It also can't do anything
to the moles underground.</b>

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:54.680
<b>A mole can get the best of a
lion by retreating into the earth.</b>

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:57.100
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:59.020
<b>Come on, give me your best shot!</b>

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:06.030
<b>If you force an Over Soul, your
mind will snap and you'll die!</b>

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:08.570
<b>I won't die.</b>

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:12.410
<b>You're in my world now...</b>

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:15.980
<b>And here I'm the king.</b>

